        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The person who made this game is a super coward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He likes games but cannot play horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So he made a horror game that he himself could play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He had no skill to make games, but he studied with AI and made a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is only about not looking back even if you see something scary, and just walking forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not be afraid. Even the super coward developer cleared this game. He became immune to horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is controlled only with mouse and W, A, S, D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playtime takes about 15–20 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be cleared even by a super coward. You must endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your courage is praised.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The person who made this game is a super coward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He likes games but cannot play horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So he made a horror game that he himself could play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He had no skill to make games, but he studied with AI and made a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is only about not looking back even if you see something scary, and just walking forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not be afraid. Even the super coward developer cleared this game. He became immune to horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is controlled only with mouse and W, A, S, D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playtime takes about 15–20 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be cleared even by a super coward. You must endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your courage is praised.</p>",
